OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start, with rain soon
OL,6,Fmoving northeastwards to all areas.
OL,7,FOccasionally heavy rain from late
OL,8,Fmorning will ease during the
OL,9,Fafternoon, perhaps allowing some late
OL,10,Fbrightness. Winds strengthening again.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mostly dry evening, with
OL,13,Fclear spells. Cloud thickening in the
OL,14,Fearly hours, with further occasionally
OL,15,Fheavy rain arriving late in the night.
OL,16,FWinds becoming strong overnight,
OL,17,Fespecially on coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
