OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FEarly rain clearing around
OL,6,Fmid-morning, then a brighter day with
OL,7,Fsunny spells, perhaps with an isolated
OL,8,Fblustery shower. Winds gradually
OL,9,Feasing.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,12,Fspells Wednesday, with isolated
OL,13,Fshowers. Winds falling light. Foggy
OL,14,FThursday morning, with sunny spells
OL,15,Flater. Likely mostly dry with sunny
OL,16,Fspells Friday. Temperatures near
OL,17,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
